\subsubsection parameters ROS parameters

Reads and maintains the following parameters on the ROS server

- \b "~battery_voltage" : \b [double] battery voltage min: 0.0, default: 28.0, max: 32.0
- \b "~temperature_mower" : \b [double] battery voltage min: 0.0, default: 40.0, max: 100.0
- \b "~is_charging" : \b [bool] is charging min: False, default: False, max: True
- \b "~mower_error" : \b [bool] mower error min: False, default: False, max: True
- \b "~mower_running" : \b [bool] mower running min: False, default: False, max: True
- \b "~wheels_stalled" : \b [bool] wheels_stalled min: False, default: False, max: True
- \b "~emergency_stop" : \b [bool] emergency_stop min: False, default: False, max: True

